---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Governance | DigiiState OS">
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 py-24">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 p-16 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-950 uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8">Brokerage Governance</h1>
			<div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none">
				<p class="text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-12">System Version: OS v1.3.1 | Effective: Aug 21, 2026</p>
				
				<h3>1. Operating Model & Digital Deed Exclusivity</h3>
				<p>DigiiState operates as a Digital Real Estate Infrastructure provider. We own, develop, and maintain high-performance digital territories (assets). Each territory is anchored by an immutable "Digital Deed" in our Supabase system of record. We guarantee 100% exclusivity for leased assets within their specified geographic and industry parameters. No two partners shall ever receive the same lead flow from a single DigiiState asset.</p>

				<h3>2. The Bloomberg Protocol (Data Integrity)</h3>
				<p>Our "Bloomberg Protocol" ensuring institutional-grade data transparency means all lead data, call recordings, and search engine rankings are accessible to partners via their dedicated Partner Portals. All performance metrics are reconciled daily against authoritative production records stored in our PostgreSQL cloud infrastructure.</p>

				<h3>3. Risk Mitigation & SEO Governance</h3>
				<p>We actively monitor algorithmic search volatility using our Quad-Pulse engine. Any asset experiencing a ranking collapse (Rank > 10) triggers a "Critical Management Attention" alert, mandating immediate technical intervention to protect partner lead velocity.</p>

				<div class="bg-blue-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-blue-100 mt-12">
					<p class="text-blue-900 font-bold italic mb-0">"Stability is the foundation for scale. We govern our digital properties with the same rigor as institutional physical real estate."</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
